olta fondi per salvare l’oasi: un ballo scolastico.  Ma non tutto sembra andare per il verso giusto e l’arrivo in città di un nuovo ragazzo rompe alcuni equilibri…"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Charlotte, a spontaneous and creative girl, is busy organizing a school dance to raise the necessary funds to save the natural oasis where she spent the best moments of her childhood. She tries in every way to show herself perfect in the eyes of the whole school, but in this way she ends up losing her sincerity, ruining her love story with Davide and above all the relationship with her best friend, Sophia. To find the things that really matter, Charlotte must first be able to find herself."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDd1xOG7rImowtqcsPRncp5f5v0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4VdnSfwrl6c0cNJupvkEPr95OQa.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1048772,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDd1xOG7rImowtqcsPRncp5f5v0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fDd1xOG7rImowtqcsPRncp5f5v0.jpg","language":"it","width":1750,"height":2500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDd1xOG7rImowtqcsPRncp5f5v0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fDd1xOG7rImowtqcsPRncp5f5v0.jpg","language":"it","width":1750,"height":2500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9HoDereG80CM0aaA9LBeOGslf5C.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9HoDereG80CM0aaA9LBeOGslf5C.jpg","language":"it","width":1540,"height":2200}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type"